config DIBS_OPEN_DEBUG_PORT
	bool "Keep the SWD debug port open"
	default y
	help
	  The board uses nRF52832 build code G (Rev 3), whose debug port is
	  locked after every reset unless UICR.APPROTECT is HwDisabled (0x5A).
	  With it locked, the next J-Link/nrfutil connection has to recover
	  (erase) the chip, so RTT and debugging stop working after the first
	  reset. When enabled, the board writes 0x5A to UICR.APPROTECT on the
	  first boot and resets once.

	  Turn this off for production firmware.
